  message: "Cross-ref 2026-06-24: INV-gojit (merged) added Java imports-edge emission (java.py _extract_import_edges) that uses TWO of the four fragmented import evidence_type names -- import_declaration (regular + wildcard imports) and import_static (static imports). So Java is now an additional producer to update when the import evidence_type vocabulary is consolidated (alongside the python ast_import and the import_statement producers). Semantic note for the consolidation call: import_static is arguably a DISTINCT inference pathway (static-member import) vs the generic import_declaration -- decide keep-separate vs fold when harmonizing."  # 3a57
