  clock: 12  # 91dd
  nonce: 91dd  # 91dd
  message: "Superseded by audit-findings 0004 (RESOLVED, ADR-0024 four-leakage-test): the import family (ast_import / import_statement / import_directive / import_declaration / import_static) is CANONICAL registry-sanctioned per-language synonymy on the single inference_pathway axis -- ADR-0028's explicit no-migration cluster -- NOT a fragmentation violation. The flagged 'vestigial' singletons are live + distinct (callback_argument_reference, use_declaration, trait_impl): corpus-snapshot singletons are not vestigial (the INV-vavat keep-distinct precedent). No axis-purity violation; the parent INV-numat single-axis frame holds for these values. The genuine evidence_type smuggling in this family -- Cluster D call-construct (ast_call_method) -- was folded under WI-nibis/WI-hubit (vocab:F1). This item's 'fold the 4 import names' premise was the cross-artifact mixed signal that conflicted with 0004; aligning status to the authoritative verdict so it stops steering toward folding canonical values."  # 91dd
